# Test and scratch files.
#
# Debugging this deployment produced .env.t (a full copy of production
# secrets) and several throwaway scripts sitting next to the real code. None
# were committed, but only because nobody ran `git add .` at the wrong moment.
# Matching the patterns rather than the exact names means the next scratch file
# is covered too.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
t.js
rt.js
vt.js
boot-preload.js
*.bak
*.backup
